We have merged the MUD instances. If you had a previous account
(@UNDO.IT) simply create your account as you had it before, and
your alts will be present. When you log in your alt you will
default to an immortal room. To exit: simply enter the toilet,
and plop your in center square. Welcome back.

- The codebase has been stablized and bug fixes will start
happening. If you find bugs that are crashing the mud please
let us know.

Currently LD alts on the same account can cause a crash
If you plan on running more than two alts at a time on the
same account contact Erasmus and get details on how to move
your alts onto another account.

Shaman spell Chrism, the bead necklace when worn crashes the
mud when it completes the affect cycle. This spell will be
disabled until a fix is found.
